Subject: [PATCH] ppc64le platform: the mkinitcpio HOOKS baseline

POWER boots a systemd initramfs with no Limine (so no btrfs-overlayfs),
no CPU microcode and no encryption hook, since petitboot cannot read an
encrypted /boot.

Generated from the ppc64le-platform branch (v4.5.0 + 380bd7170 "Add the
ppc64le platform" + 296d4d7ee "Refuse an unsupported CPU instead of calling
it x86") with:

    git diff v4.5.0..ppc64le-platform -- etc/

Paths are upstream's git paths. The PKGBUILD applies it with
patch -p1 -d "$pkgdir", which lands them on the installed layout.

diff --git a/etc/mkinitcpio.conf.d/00-omarchy-hooks.conf b/etc/mkinitcpio.conf.d/00-omarchy-hooks.conf
index dda5da9a0..8ea7a4326 100644
--- a/etc/mkinitcpio.conf.d/00-omarchy-hooks.conf
+++ b/etc/mkinitcpio.conf.d/00-omarchy-hooks.conf
@@ -3,8 +3,9 @@
 # after it add their hooks to it instead of being overwritten by it.
 #
 # Apple Silicon boots a systemd initramfs, and its platform package adds the
-# firmware and encryption hooks. Every other machine keeps the busybox line, as
-# does one without the runtime's detector. A detector that cannot place the
+# firmware and encryption hooks. POWER boots a systemd initramfs too. Every
+# other machine keeps the busybox line, as does one without the runtime's
+# detector. A detector that cannot place the
 # machine stops the build rather than let it produce an image for the wrong
 # platform.
 _omarchy_platform=""
@@ -30,6 +31,12 @@ case $_omarchy_platform in
   aarch64-apple)
     HOOKS=(base systemd plymouth autodetect microcode modconf kms keyboard sd-vconsole block filesystems fsck)
     ;;
+  # POWER has no Limine, so nothing provides the busybox line's btrfs-overlayfs
+  # hook and mkinitcpio would fail without it; nor CPU microcode to load.
+  # petitboot cannot read an encrypted /boot, so there is no encryption hook.
+  ppc64le | ppc64le-power9)
+    HOOKS=(base systemd plymouth autodetect modconf kms keyboard keymap sd-vconsole block filesystems fsck)
+    ;;
   *)
     HOOKS=(base udev plymouth keyboard autodetect microcode modconf kms keymap consolefont block encrypt filesystems fsck btrfs-overlayfs)
     ;;
